# A concert poster over the desk (issue 074), an abstract impression with no text or name: an unframed paper poster with a pale border and tape at the top corners, an orange and gold geometric field split by an S-curve, a pale disc and a dark bar. It shares the geometric idea of painting-desk (the framed gold print) but is a different object: no frame, no mat, mirrored colours.
size: 32x16
